## 3. UI/UX — PROFESSIONAL, RINGAN, INTERNATIONAL CLASS
WAJIB. Bukan dashboard ramai. Bukan template lokal murahan.

1. Bahasa UI default: English. Data tenant boleh bilingual.
2. Kesan: Datadog / Linear / Apple NOC — tenang, presisi, mahal.
3. Dark mode default. Light mode opsional di header. Kontras aksesibel (WCAG AA).
4. Font: Inter (UI) + JetBrains Mono (hostname, IP, metric, log).
5. Warna: Primary #00E5C3, background gelap dalam, 1 aksen. Hindari rainbow badge.
6. Komponen: shadcn/ui. Animasi framer-motion 200ms, ease-out, tidak berlebihan.
7. Layout: sidebar collapsible + header sticky + global search. Density nyaman, whitespace cukup.
8. Kartu KPI ringkas: angka mono, 1 hint, 0 dekorasi sia-sia.
9. Tabel: zebra halus, status pill, hostname + IP mono.
10. Topology: visual bersih, node kecil, edge tipis, label tidak bertabrakan.
11. Dilarang: shadow berat, gradient kitsch, emoji di navigasi, skeleton flashy, autoplay noise.
12. Performa: first paint cepat, chart lazy, query selalu `tenant_id`.
13. Copy: pendek, profesional, tidak basecamp/slang. Error message manusiawi.

## 4. MODE DEPLOY — ON CLOUD & ON PREMISE (WAJIB SAMA FITUR)
Satu codebase. Fitur Cloud = fitur On-Prem. Yang beda hanya edge (Traefik vs port 3000) dan `IS_SAAS`.

### MODE A — CLOUD SAAS `docker-compose.cloud.yml`
- Multi tenant di netmon.click
- Akses: https://acme.netmon.click
- Traefik + Let's Encrypt wildcard `*.netmon.click`
- `IS_SAAS=true`

### MODE B — ON-PREMISE `docker-compose.onprem.yml`
- Semua di server pelanggan. Tidak kirim data ke netmon.click kecuali pelanggan setuju.
- Akses: https://nms.perusahaan.com (atau IP:3000)
- Tidak pakai Traefik. Langsung port 3000
- `IS_SAAS=false`
- `NEXTAUTH_URL=https://nms.perusahaan.com`
- AI jalan lokal (rules engine). LLM cloud opsional via `AI_API_KEY` pelanggan.

## 5. DATABASE SCHEMA PRISMA
model tenant { id String @id @default(cuid()) name String slug String @unique domain String management_email String brand_color String? device_limit Int @default(100) status String @default("active") plan String @default("cloud_basic") }
model user { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String email String @unique role String @default("viewer") }
model device { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String hostname String ip String type String status String @default("unknown") @@unique([tenant_id, hostname]) @@unique([ip]) }
model device_link { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String from_device_id String to_device_id String status String @default("up") }
model alert { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String device_id String event String status String @default("firing") severity String @default("critical") created_at DateTime @default(now()) }
model sla { id String @id @default(cuid()) device_id String @unique uptime_30d Float @default(100) }
model metric { id String @id @default(cuid()) device_id String ts DateTime @default(now()) cpu_percent Float ram_percent Float disk_percent Float }
model dashboard { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String name String layout Json }
model audit_log { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String user_id String action String created_at DateTime @default(now()) }
model subscription { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String @unique status String }
model cmdb_ci { id String @id @default(cuid()) tenant_id String device_id String? ci_type String name String asset_tag String? serial String? owner String? status String @default("in_service") location String? }

## 6. DOCKER COMPOSE CLOUD SAAS
File: `docker-compose.cloud.yml`
Pakai IP 103.190.214.224 + Traefik untuk subdomain
```yaml
version: '3.8'
services:
 traefik:
 image: traefik:v3.0
 command:
 - "--api.dashboard=true"
 - "--providers.docker=true"
 - "--entrypoints.web.address=:80"
 - "--entrypoints.websecure.address=:443"
 - "--certificatesresolvers.letsencrypt.acme.email=admin@netmon.click"
 - "--certificatesresolvers.letsencrypt.acme.storage=/letsencrypt/acme.json"
 - "--certificatesresolvers.letsencrypt.acme.tlschallenge=true"
 ports:
 - "80:80"
 - "443:443"
 volumes:
 - /var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock
 - ./letsencrypt:/letsencrypt

 web:
 image: netmon/web:latest
 environment:
 DATABASE_URL: postgresql://nms:xxx@postgres:5432/nms
 REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379
 NEXTAUTH_URL: https://netmon.click
 APP_URL: https://netmon.click
 IS_SAAS: true
 SERVER_IP: 103.190.214.224
 labels:
 - "traefik.enable=true"
 - "traefik.http.routers.web.rule=Host(`netmon.click`) || HostRegexp(`{subdomain:[a-z0-9-]+}.netmon.click`)"
 - "traefik.http.routers.web.entrypoints=websecure"
 - "traefik.http.routers.web.tls.certresolver=letsencrypt"
 depends_on: [postgres, redis]

 worker:
 image: netmon/worker:latest
 environment:
 DATABASE_URL: postgresql://nms:xxx@postgres:5432/nms
 REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379

 postgres:
 image: postgres:16
 volumes: [postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data]

 redis:
 image: redis:7-alpine
volumes: { postgres_data: }
```

## 7. DOCKER COMPOSE ON-PREMISE
File: `docker-compose.onprem.yml`
Tidak pakai Traefik. Langsung port 3000
`IS_SAAS=false`
`NEXTAUTH_URL=https://nms.perusahaan.com`

## 8. MULTI-TENANCY
1. ISOLASI MUTLAK: SEMUA query `where: { tenant_id: auth.tenant_id }`
2. SUBDOMAIN: dari `req.headers.host`. `acme.netmon.click` -> tenant.slug = acme
3. On-prem single-tenant: tetap pakai tenant_id (satu tenant default)

## 9. RBAC — ROLE BASED ACCESS CONTROL (WAJIB)
Bukan hanya label role. Setiap aksi dicek permission.

### Roles
- superadmin — platform NETMON (semua tenant)
- admin — pemilik tenant, user, billing, write penuh
- operator — operasi NOC: device, alert, poller, CMDB write. Tidak kelola user/billing
- viewer — customer portal. READ ONLY

### Permission matrix
| Permission | superadmin | admin | operator | viewer |
| assets.read / cmdb.read / topology.read / sla.read / alert.read | Y | Y | Y | Y (portal) |
| assets.write / cmdb.write / topology.write / alert.write / bulk / import | Y | Y | Y | N |
| ai.use | Y | Y | Y | Y (hanya data tenant sendiri) |
| users.manage / security.manage | Y | Y | N | N |
| dashboard.builder / reports.export / agent.enroll | Y | Y | Y | N |
| platform.admin | Y | N | N | N |

Viewer yang buka `/dashboard` WAJIB redirect ke `/portal`.
Semua API write menolak viewer (403). Audit setiap write.

## 10. CUSTOMER PORTAL — JAWABAN PRODUK
Bila customer (role viewer) login ke `/portal`:

YA. Dia mendapat SEMUA aset tenant-nya, secara read-only:

1. Asset inventory — hostname, IP, type, vendor, location, status
2. CMDB — CI, asset tag, serial, owner, relasi ke device
3. Visual topology — peta tautan live (sama data dengan NOC, tanpa edit)
4. SLA 30 hari + status page publik
5. Alert/incident yang sedang firing (tanpa acknowledge/resolve)
6. NETMON AI insights (ringkasan, bukan aksi destruktif)

TIDAK boleh: tambah/hapus device, bulk, import, user management, agent token, dashboard builder, superadmin, ubah topology, jalankan perintah ke device.

Portal = kaca. NOC = kemudi.

## 11. NETMON AI (WAJIB)
Modul AI Copilot. Tenant-scoped. Tidak boleh bocor lintas tenant.

Fitur:
1. Ringkas alert firing jadi bahasa operator
2. Root-cause hint dari topology + status neighbor
3. Pertanyaan natural: "device mana yang SLA-nya jelek?"
4. Saran kapasitas CPU/RAM/disk 24 jam
5. Jawaban portal aman: tidak membocorkan user lain / secret / token

Mode:
- LOCAL (default on-prem): rules + data Prisma. Tanpa internet.
- CLOUD LLM: jika `AI_API_KEY` di-set (OpenAI-compatible). Tetap inject konteks tenant saja.

Route: `/dashboard/ai` dan `/portal/ai`
API: `POST /api/ai/ask` body `{ question }`

Dilarang: AI menulis ke device, AI bypass RBAC, AI lihat tenant lain.

## 12. MODUL WAJIB
MODUL 1-4: POLLER, ALERT, SLA, TOPOLOGY
MODUL 5: IMPORT CSV/EXCEL
MODUL 6: BULK ACTIONS
MODUL 7: REPORT PDF
MODUL 8: STATUS PAGE /status/[tenant]
MODUL 9: SECURITY + 2FA + SSO
MODUL 10: AGENT
MODUL 11: DASHBOARD BUILDER
MODUL 12: PORTAL CUSTOMER /portal (assets + CMDB + topology + AI)
MODUL 13: USER MANAGEMENT + RBAC
MODUL 14: ONBOARDING /signup
MODUL 15: SUPERADMIN /admin
MODUL 16: CMDB /dashboard/cmdb dan /portal/cmdb
MODUL 17: NETMON AI /dashboard/ai dan /portal/ai

